fixtures/deck.html exercises colspan/rowspan tables, opacity, overflow
clipping, images, and both chart-recovery tiers; slide13.html is the
original single-slide fixture. logo.png is regenerated deterministically
(stdlib PNG writer) because the original binary was not recoverable from
the handoff packet — Layer B hashes source vs embedded of the same file,
so the gate is unaffected (see docs/lessons.md #17).

